     1[0m[2m. **`inventory[0m[2m.py`**: Add[0m[2m an[0m[2m `asyncio.Lock[0m[2m` to `Inventory[0m[2m`. Make `de[0m[2mcrement` acquire[0m[2m the lock so[0m[2m check[0m[2m +[0m[2m decrement is atomic.[0m[2m This[0m[2m eliminates[0m[2m the TOCTOU[0m[2m race.
     
     2.[0m[2m **`checkout.py[0m[2m`**: Change[0m[2m the order[0m[2m:[0m[2m decrement[0m[2m inventory[0m[2m first ([0m[2mwhich[0m[2m is now atomic),[0m[2m then charge.[0m[2m If charge fails,[0m[2m roll[0m[2m back inventory[0m[2m ([0m[2mincrement). This prevents[0m[2m ghost charges -[0m[2m we[0m[2m only charge after[0m[2m we[0m[2m've secured[0m[2m the item[0m[2m.
     
